st/the-thieves-guild-quest\">The Thieves Guild Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-travelling-trader-quest\">The Travelling Trader Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-way-of-the-monk-quest\">The Way of the Monk Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/twisted-waters-world-change\">Twisted Waters World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/waterfall-quest\">Waterfall Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a Foolish Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.5<br/>August 09, 2005<br/>Summer Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Links</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Streets</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Buildings</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Towns</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Port Hope</b> is a beautiful city in the jungle west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. The city was at first settled by a few sailors who shipwrecked here when traveling from <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, and is now inhabited with colonizers from all over the Tibian continent.\nSurrounded by the hostile jungle full of enemies and threats people have never seen before, the town is in constant need of valiant protectors and explorers. Hunters and adventurers alike meet here for their expeditions into the jungle and share the tales of their latest missions. For the junior hunter, in town there is a hole to a cave with minor monsters.\nIt's part of the Kingdom of Thais\n</p><p><b>Geographical Location</b>: <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32629,32769,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Here (32629, 32769, 7)</a> is the map of Port Hope using Mapper.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span id=\"w-Port_Hope_NPCs_.2841_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Port_Hope_NPCs_(41_NPCs)\">Port Hope NPCs (41 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Andrew%20Lyze\">Andrew Lyze</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Andrew%20Lyze\"><img alt=\"Andrew Lyze\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Andrew_Lyze_29640c.gif\" width=\"84\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Unknown.\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Banuta, Port Hope.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Angus\">Angus</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Angus\"><img alt=\"Angus\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Angus_f5aac7.gif\" width=\"6